# Evidence Project - E-Commerce API

## Description
This repository contains the backend implementation for the Evidence Project, built with Laravel. The application manages core e-commerce workflows including user profiles, product items, categories, and customer orders. 

Database seeding and factories have been configured with **FakerPHP** to generate realistic mock data (including 3 fixed users and 50 generated orders) with data types matching production requirements.

## Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS ||--o{ ORDERS : places
    CATEGORIES ||--o{ ITEMS : contains
    ORDERS ||--|{ ORDER_ITEMS : contains
    ITEMS ||--|{ ORDER_ITEMS : included_in

    USERS {
        bigint id PK
        string name
        string email
        timestamp created_at
    }

    ORDERS {
        bigint id PK
        bigint user_id FK
        string order_number
        decimal total
        string status
        timestamp created_at
    }


